# Optional environment variables for picklock.
#
# picklock itself is configured from the command line (DSN) and the connection
# screen; it reads no environment variables at runtime.
#
# This file documents the variables used by the test suite and the demo
# seeder. Values below match the repo's compose.yaml. Note that Go does not
# load .env files automatically: export the values yourself, e.g.
#
#   docker compose up -d --wait
#   set -a; source .env; set +a        # or set each var inline, as in README
#   go test -timeout 300s ./internal/store/...
#
# All variables are OPTIONAL: tests are skipped when the *_HOST var is unset,
# and the demo seeder falls back to these same defaults.

# --- Integration tests (network engines; need `docker compose up -d` first) ---
# Relational engines are tested against the PICKLOCK_TEST_POSTGRES_*, PICKLOCK_TEST_MYSQL_*,
# PICKLOCK_TEST_MARIADB_* and PICKLOCK_TEST_MSSQL_* sets below; the document/key-value/
# wide-column/graph engines use PICKLOCK_TEST_MONGODB_*, PICKLOCK_TEST_REDIS_*,
# PICKLOCK_TEST_CASSANDRA_* and PICKLOCK_TEST_NEO4J_*. Every var is optional and each
# package skips its integration tests when its _HOST var is unset.

PICKLOCK_TEST_POSTGRES_HOST=localhost
PICKLOCK_TEST_POSTGRES_USER=postgres
PICKLOCK_TEST_POSTGRES_PASSWORD=postgres
PICKLOCK_TEST_POSTGRES_DATABASE=test

PICKLOCK_TEST_MYSQL_HOST=localhost
PICKLOCK_TEST_MYSQL_USER=root
PICKLOCK_TEST_MYSQL_PASSWORD=root
PICKLOCK_TEST_MYSQL_DATABASE=test

PICKLOCK_TEST_MARIADB_HOST=localhost
PICKLOCK_TEST_MARIADB_USER=root
PICKLOCK_TEST_MARIADB_PASSWORD=root
PICKLOCK_TEST_MARIADB_DATABASE=test

PICKLOCK_TEST_MSSQL_HOST=localhost
PICKLOCK_TEST_MSSQL_USER=sa
PICKLOCK_TEST_MSSQL_PASSWORD=Str0ng!Passw0rd
PICKLOCK_TEST_MSSQL_DATABASE=master

PICKLOCK_TEST_MONGODB_HOST=localhost
PICKLOCK_TEST_MONGODB_PORT=27017
PICKLOCK_TEST_MONGODB_DATABASE=test

PICKLOCK_TEST_REDIS_HOST=localhost
PICKLOCK_TEST_REDIS_PORT=6379

PICKLOCK_TEST_CASSANDRA_HOST=localhost
PICKLOCK_TEST_CASSANDRA_PORT=9042

PICKLOCK_TEST_NEO4J_HOST=localhost
PICKLOCK_TEST_NEO4J_PORT=7687
PICKLOCK_TEST_NEO4J_USER=neo4j
PICKLOCK_TEST_NEO4J_PASSWORD=password
PICKLOCK_TEST_NEO4J_DATABASE=neo4j

# --- Demo seeder (`go run ./cmd/demo --all`); overrides the defaults above ---
# Any of POSTGRES_HOST/POSTGRES_PORT/POSTGRES_USER/POSTGRES_PASSWORD/
# POSTGRES_DATABASE (and the parallel MYSQL_/MARIADB_/MSSQL_ variants), plus
# DEMO_SQLITE_PATH for the demo.db path.

# --- User configuration ---
# Overrides the config directory used for history.json, connections.json and
# prefs.json (default: ~/.config/picklock).
# PICKLOCK_CONFIG_DIR=/path/to/config